{"id":"f530ad4c65761317","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-canonical-relation-powers.md","title":"Powers of the Canonical Accessibility Relation","display":"lem-canonical-relation-powers — Powers of the Canonical Accessibility Relation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-canonical-relation-powers","aliases":["89-lem-canonical-relation-powers"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-canonical-relation-powers — Powers of the Canonical Accessibility Relation","depends_on":["[[89-df-canonical-model]]","[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","[[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]]","[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]","[[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-canonical-relation-powers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-canonical-relation-powers</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-canonical-relation-powers — Powers of the Canonical Accessibility Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c922518c30c4107d\" href=\"?note=c922518c30c4107d\" title=\"89-df-canonical-model\">89-df-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" href=\"?note=e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" title=\"89-df-modal-iteration\">89-df-modal-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"646a96fe655f6d74\" href=\"?note=646a96fe655f6d74\" title=\"89-lem-lindenbaum-modal\">89-lem-lindenbaum-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7c0e4d58dc068222\" href=\"?note=7c0e4d58dc068222\" title=\"89-lem-normal-box-lifting\">89-lem-normal-box-lifting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"92c4449a6fa3b997\" href=\"?note=92c4449a6fa3b997\" title=\"89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties\">89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin L\">\\(\\bot\\notin L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in W_L\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in W_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_L^n\">\\(R_L^n\\)</span> 为关系幂，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^n\">\\(\\Box^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond^n\">\\(\\Diamond^n\\)</span> 为模态迭代。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}relation\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma R_L^n\\Delta\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(\\Box^n A\\in\\Gamma\\to A\\in\\Delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\Delta\\;(\\Diamond^n B\\in\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}relation\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma R_L^n\\Delta\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(\\Box^n A\\in\\Gamma\\to A\\in\\Delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\Delta\\;(\\Diamond^n B\\in\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 88；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时右侧说 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\)</span>，极大一致性保证相等。正向沿路径逐个去盒。逆向假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^{n+1}A\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\Box^{n+1}A\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta\">\\(A\\in\\Delta\\)</span>，取\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z=\\{\\Diamond B:B\\in\\Delta\\}\\cup\\{C:\\Box^n C\\in\\Gamma\\}\">\\(Z=\\{\\Diamond B:B\\in\\Delta\\}\\cup\\{C:\\Box^n C\\in\\Gamma\\}\\)</span>。\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 不一致，选有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i\\in\\Delta,C_j\">\\(B_i\\in\\Delta,C_j\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\bigwedge_iB_i\">\\(B=\\bigwedge_iB_i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\bigwedge_jC_j\">\\(C=\\bigwedge_jC_j\\)</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond B\\to\\bigwedge_i\\Diamond B_i\">\\(\\Diamond B\\to\\bigwedge_i\\Diamond B_i\\)</span> 和有限反驳得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C\\to\\Box\\neg B)\\in L\">\\((C\\to\\Box\\neg B)\\in L\\)</span>，经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 次盒提升推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^{n+1}\\neg B\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\Box^{n+1}\\neg B\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。假设迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg B\\in\\Delta\">\\(\\neg B\\in\\Delta\\)</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Delta\">\\(B\\in\\Delta\\)</span> 矛盾。空列表分别取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>，论证仍成立。\n把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 扩张为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\in W_L\">\\(\\Theta\\in W_L\\)</span>；归纳假设给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma R_L^n\\Theta\">\\(\\Gamma R_L^n\\Theta\\)</span>，菱形/盒的否定对偶给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta R_L\\Delta\">\\(\\Theta R_L\\Delta\\)</span>。最后一条等价也由极大一致性和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond^n B\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box^n\\neg B\">\\(\\Diamond^n B\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box^n\\neg B\\)</span> 得到。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"c922518c30c4107d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-lindenbaum-modal","status":"resolved","id":"646a96fe655f6d74","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-normal-box-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"7c0e4d58dc068222","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties","status":"resolved","id":"92c4449a6fa3b997","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\notin L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in W_L","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R_L^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}relation\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma R_L^n\\Delta\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(\\Box^n A\\in\\Gamma\\to A\\in\\Delta)\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\Delta\\;(\\Diamond^n B\\in\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^{n+1}A\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"Z=\\{\\Diamond B:B\\in\\Delta\\}\\cup\\{C:\\Box^n C\\in\\Gamma\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"B_i\\in\\Delta,C_j","display":false},{"tex":"B=\\bigwedge_iB_i","display":false},{"tex":"C=\\bigwedge_jC_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond B\\to\\bigwedge_i\\Diamond B_i","display":false},{"tex":"(C\\to\\Box\\neg B)\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^{n+1}\\neg B\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg B\\in\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta\\in W_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma R_L^n\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta R_L\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond^n B\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box^n\\neg B","display":false}],"bytes":1945,"backlinks":[{"id":"a668d880013388bd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"收敛：[[89-df-modal-iteration]] → [[89-lem-canonical-relation-powers]] → [[89-df-convergent-frame]] → [[89-thm-canonical-convergence]] → [[89-thm-convergence-completeness]]。边界：[[89-prop-gl-canonical-transitive]]、[[89-ex-gl-canonical-reflexive-world]]。"}],"outgoing":["c922518c30c4107d","e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","646a96fe655f6d74","7c0e4d58dc068222","92c4449a6fa3b997"]}